   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Groupe de Recherch&#xe9; et D&#x2019;Echanges Tecnologiques (GRET) for Microfinance services for poor and vulnerable people in Burma is a component of Microfinance Services for Poor and Vulnerable People in Burma reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;670,009. It works in the following sector(s): Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries.</narrative>
